# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Generated data: data/starter and data/full ARE committed (CSV/JSON/SQL, ground truth, manifest, checksums,
# validation summary). Only the 240 MB SQLite build artefact exceeds GitHub's 100 MB file limit.
# Rebuild it with:  coldchain generate --scale full --out data/full
# or from the committed dump:  zcat data/full/seed.sql.gz | sqlite3 coldchain.db
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
data/full/coldchain.db
build/

